<title>PHILIPPINES: Fil-Estate sets 100 percent stock div.</title>
<headline>Fil-Estate sets 100 percent stock div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fil-Estate Land Inc said on Tuesday it would pay a 100 percent stock dividend to shareholders.</p>
<p>It set the annual stockholders meet on March 6 for the approval of the 100 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>In 1996 and 1995, the company did not declare any stock dividends.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom 63 2 841-8937 fax 8176267</p>
</text>
